        },
        "type": "content"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": "Determine Molar Solubility from "
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": "K"
                  },
                  {
                    "strong": true,
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "sp"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "i9sp0vu6sff255b",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "The "
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "K"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "sp"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " for copper(I) bromide, CuBr, is 6.3 × 10"
                  },
                  {
                    "sup": true,
                    "text": "–9"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". Calculate the molar solubility of copper bromide."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "m3dmuhc4bvvywuc",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "First, we determine the dissolution reaction that occurs:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "7ly4e877xjcegcc",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "ntpdnccov8vr7gm",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "jrkz2bzvt8n41md",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "\\mathrm{CuBr}(s)\\;\\;\\rightleftharpoons\\;\\;\\mathrm{Cu}^+(aq)\\;+\\;\\mathrm{Br}^-(aq)",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Next, we write the solubility product expression from the dissolution reaction:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "u3jq9pf34k7i4us",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "sbwcyvocmzz6k87",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "r1zoc27a5y4f8x2",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "K_{\\mathrm{sp}}\\;=\\;\\lbrack\\mathrm{Cu}^+\\rbrack\\lbrack\\mathrm{Br}^-\\rbrack",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "We can use an ICE table to determine the relative concentrations of the species present at equilibrium. Note that CuBr is a solid, so it does not appear in the "
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "K"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "sp"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". However, it is indicated as “excess” in the table because the solution must be saturated upon dissolution for equilibrium to be reached."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "9v1x51ev111p153",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "___selfClosing___": true,
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "id": "700ir90x0oe6388",
                            "text": " ",
                            "type": "text"
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "6bgak1d3do5xjhj",
                        "type": "td"
                      },
                      {
                        "align": "center",
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "id": "g4ku5wkwzqq3g9l",
                            "strong": true,
                            "text": "CuBr("
                          },
                          {
                            "em": true,
                            "id": "pfrft4nkcdxk26h",
                            "strong": true,
                            "text": "s"
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "0rcof7lv1f7byk0",
                            "strong": true,
                            "text": ") ⇌ Cu"
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "xks162dquw49r1p",
                            "strong": true,
                            "sup": true,
                            "text": "+"
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "2q5h5uw2l8zklvi",
                            "strong": true,
                            "text": "("
                          },
                          {
                            "em": true,
                            "id": "w43fb6uevhpt18i",
                            "strong": true,
                            "text": "aq"
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "3ckk3ekm2b5llr3",
                            "strong": true,
                            "text": ") + Br"
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "fkjyximg5rtjiq9",
                            "strong": true,
                            "sup": true,
                            "text": "–"
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "sopxjhbwlss6wwr",
                            "strong": true,
                            "text": "("
                          },
                          {
                            "em": true,
                            "id": "6wm7r89fdvy8biu",
                            "strong": true,
                            "text": "aq"
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "69j0cbosruspiqg",
                            "strong": true,
                            "text": ")"
                          }
                        ],
